flowchart LR
    subgraph Core[Core / Domain]
        RepoContract[ProductRepository\nContract owned by the core]
        UseCase[ProductApplicationService\nDepends on the contract, not the implementation]
        Rules[Business rules\nValidation + invariants]
    end

    subgraph External[External Infrastructure]
        JpaAdapter[JPA repository adapter\nImplements ProductRepository]
        Database[(MariaDB / H2)]
    end

    UseCase --> RepoContract
    Rules --> UseCase
    JpaAdapter --> RepoContract
    JpaAdapter --> Database

    Note1[Dependency direction\npoints inward]:::note
    Note2[Core defines the storage shape\nand external code conforms]:::note
    Note1 -.-> RepoContract
    Note2 -.-> JpaAdapter

    classDef note fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#e65100,color:#000;